## Slide 5

Performance Related Pages 

## Slide 6

Job List Pages 	

Planned Jobs
Lists Jobs assigned to the System that have yet to begin.
Completed Jobs
Lists Jobs assigned to the System that have ended.
Allow filtering by Date Range and Product
Support common Actions

## Slide 7

Job Action Pages 	

Start Job
Confirmation and execution.  Sets Job and Product Tags based on System configuration.
End Job
Confirmation and execution.  Clears Job and Product Tags based on System configuration.
Redirects to System Overview

## Slide 8

Real-Time Event List

Contains Events for the System which have been configured to display for Categorization and/or Acknowledgement
Displays Active and Ended Events
Can show Events for multiple Systems
Supports common Actions

## Slide 9

Event Attention

Displays details for a selected Event
Offers Options
Change Event Definition
Change Event Category
Edit Notes
Split
Acknowledge clears Event from the Attention List

## Slide 10

Event Categorization 

Displays Event Category Hierarchy based on Configuration
Selecting a Category with children drills down to the next level of Event Categories
Saving applies the Category to the Event

## Slide 11

Reporting Lists

Display Jobs or Shifts related to a System
Simple Date and Product Filters
Navigate to 
Event List and Editor
Interval List and Editor
Full Overview Report

## Slide 12

Overview Report

Context provided on the Left
KPI Aggregations provided in the middle
Event Breakdown provided on the right

## Slide 13

KPI Reports

Selectable Filters that can be Pre-Set and Locked
Multiple Group By options, including the use of Capture Fields for Extensibility
Built in Export to Excel button
Links to related reports for Drill-Down capabilities

## Slide 14

Performance Management Pages